WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:19.800
[Music]

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:22.960
[McGillicuddy is peeling potatoes in the galley when he realizes he needs to use the head

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.660
and waves his hand frantically.]

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:26.790
[McGillicuddy:] Hey, Sarge!

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.040
[Sarge:] Ok, McGillicuddy.

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:33.670
[Narrator:] When you gotta go, you gotta, hey look out, Mac!

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:36.400
[McGillicuddy runs out the door and into a
tree with a sign.]

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:42.480
[Sign reads: 7th Commandment: Thou shalt not use any spots except chosen ones 

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:46.360
for the deposition of your excrement.]

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:51.060
[Thou shalt not urinate in thy brother's tent
or street 

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:55.120
else he regard thee as a dog and treat thee accordingly.]

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:59.960
[Narrator:] In other words, that means: use your head!

00:00:59.969 --> 00:01:05.750
Avoid contaminating any area which could result
in dysentery for your entire unit!

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:10.100
[McGillicuddy:] Uh, I gotta to the toilet.

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:14.360
[McGillicuddy follows a sign pointing to the Head.]

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:16.140
[Another sign says Keep A Lookout]

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.260
[For A Jap]

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:21.120
[When You Go-]

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.820
[To Take A Cra-]

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:27.640
[Burna Shave]

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:32.880
[McGillicuddy reaches another sign that points to the head, but turns away and crawls into the jungle.]

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:34.760
[Narrator:] Hey, stupid! Can't you read?

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:41.200
[Mac reaches a chair with a hole in it with an umbrella over it.]

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:42.900
[Stacks of paper are piled next to the chair.]

00:01:42.909 --> 00:01:49.850
[Narrator:] Well, look at that. McGillicuddy's private one-holer. What a lay-up.

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:59.190
Sunshade, library, toilet tissue, beautiful
view, even gardenias, 

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:03.000
and a hell of a good home for dysentery germs!

00:02:03.009 --> 00:02:06.209
[McGillicuddy sits on the chair reading a comic strip and chuckling.]

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:08.780
[McGillicuddy:] Haha, what a dope.

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:11.820
[Narrator:] Yeah. What a dope.

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:15.180
[A fly is perched nearby.]

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:21.440
[McGillicuddy finishes and leaves the chair while the fly rings a triangle.]

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:23.360
[Fly:] Come and get it!

00:02:23.959 --> 00:02:26.100
[A swarm of flies heads towards the area.]

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:32.740
[McGillicuddy returns to the galley where smoke is coming out of the chimney.]

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:38.420
[The fly smells the smoke and rings the triangle again.]

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:40.020
[Fly:] Oh, dessert!

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:47.300
[Swarm of flies goes toward and into the galley's chimney.]

00:02:47.400 --> 00:03:20.820
[Flies are swarming over the food, sliding down potatoes, walking on pies, eating cheese, and swimming in the soup.]

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:28.240
[Soldiers are eating the contaminated food
in the mess hall.]

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:37.120
[Suddenly the mess tent lurches forward, propelled towards the head by all the soldiers inside.]

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:42.700
[Narrator:] And now, because of one man's carelessness, a whole unit is flat on its back!

00:03:42.709 --> 00:03:45.230
[Soldiers are in beds labeled 'Diarrhoea']

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:50.190
[Voice from bedside radio:] Ohhh, Tokyo calling, ohhh Tokyo calling!

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:55.000
[Japanese announcer:] We ha' good news! We discover we have in the South Pacific, Yankee Marine,

00:03:55.049 --> 00:03:57.580
who help our Japanese war effort.

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:03.760
This'a Yankee, all the time make honorable bowel movement in wrong location!

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:06.740
All his buddy Yankee get dysentery!

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:13.760
Woo, make weak like pussycat! This honorable Yankee a'name McGillicuddy!

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.260
[Soldiers:] McGillicuddy!?

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:18.220
[Soldiers are angry.]

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:22.480
[Narrator:] Yeah, McGillicuddy. Go get'em boys!

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:24.480
[A soldier on an excavator for the Decontamination Squad spots

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:28.540
McGillicuddy on his private head reading comics.]

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:33.460
[McGillicuddy:] Hahaha, what a dope.

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:39.220
[Excavator scoops McGillicuddy and his head off the ground.]

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:46.380
[Excavator dumps McGillicuddy in the head
that he was supposed to use.]

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:49.300
[Narrator:] McGillicuddy, you made your bed - now lie in it!

